# @caistech/* consumed from GitHub Packages. Added 2026-08-09 alongside this
# repo's FIRST CI: the marketing site had no .github directory at all — no
# typecheck, no tests, no gate — while being the public front door that quotes
# prices. An offer-claims config was committed here before anything existed to
# run it, which looks covered and is not.
#
# Token via env GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN, matching the application repo's
# convention (GitHub forbids GITHUB_-prefixed secret names, so the workflow
# aliases it from the GH_PACKAGES_TOKEN secret).
@caistech:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN}
